[Music]  it makes me more thankful in general for  sure 2017 was quite a year for Jimmy  Kimmel he hosted the Oscars to rave  reviews in February and less than two  months later in April  his wife Molly gave birth to their son  Billy who had an emergency open heart  surgery just three days after he was  born  now Kimmel is back to host the big show  on Sunday this time with a new  perspective to be honest it minimizes  the importance of something like this  which last year seemed to me to be the  most important thing in the world and  then you get this a reminder that this  is even close to the most important  thing in the world and you reminded of  that every day when you go home so in a  way yes it definitely has made me  appreciate my life more it also puts  things in perspective ET sat down with a  late-night host on Wednesday in LA he  teased what to expect did you have any  special requests for the show itself yep  more snacks in my dressing room would be  nice I mean it really was I mean enough  with the SunChips but now I don't have  meant much in the way a special request  I can go with the flow it's not my show  I'm just hosting it and I just hoping to  be funny keep the show moving and have  some stuff that maybe people will talk  about the next day  [Music]

